        <p class="text-lg text-ntc-white/90 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Nomad Theater Company is dedicated to bringing high-quality, professional theater productions to communities that might not otherwise have access to live performance. We believe that theater is a powerful tool for connection, education, and inspiration.
